Why this exists: the fleet measured wall wattage every 60s for weeks and an agent still
recommended moving a workload onto a node drawing 85W completely idle. The data was
never the problem. Nobody looked. This looks, on a timer, and pushes what it finds.

  plug-findings                 # detect + push to ntfy (deduped 24h), daily timer
